 :s4-checked-and-surfaced-basis
 {:checked "`rg -n 'throw|refus|reject|invalid' war_machine.clj` intersected with a slice-A node tag returns 0 lines -- nothing refuses on any of these nodes' values. Two-layer calibration (R12) is the assurance node that would do this and ALIGN censuses it absent."
  :surfaced "`rg -c 'notify/discharged-at|bulletin'` over war_machine.clj, observation.clj and precision.clj returns 0. Consistent with PA11z's independent finding that bulletin.clj carries zero job/dispatch/invoke references."
